                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a4389f41-3ad8-4651-a033-2e331cefb3ac",
                        "source_entry_id": "1665f8f6-5bdf-3d02-ac14-3fcfbf4e0d9e",
                        "source_sense_id": "1fa5e235-fb05-3068-b559-5495f14648a7",
                        "target_lang_word": "quantity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quantity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8c2f185-b6cf-36d3-a35e-19d55958be0a",
                                        "entry_id": "9ee3d203-6f5c-315b-a8a6-045d5ee4498d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fundamental, generic term used when referring to the measurement (count, amount) of a scalar, vector, number of items or to some other way of denominating the value of a collection or group of items."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0d26359-a63f-4536-b806-06e2b564c77d",
                                                "sense_id": "f8c2f185-b6cf-36d3-a35e-19d55958be0a",
                                                "text": "You have to choose between quantity and quality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "468b9b9e-e97e-4938-b162-294446143a3a",
                                                "sense_id": "f8c2f185-b6cf-36d3-a35e-19d55958be0a",
                                                "text": "A few comments on the words used in the title of the book and on some related expressions are necessary. A \"quantity\" is here understood in the sense of \"a thing that has the property of being measurable in dimensions, amounts, etc., or in extensions of these which can be expressed in numbers and symbols\" (Webster's New World Dictionary of [the American Language], Third Edition, 1988), or of \"something having magnitude, or size, extent, amount, and the like\" (Random House Webster's College Dictionary, 1991; The New Hamlyn Encyclopaedic World Dictionary, 1988). It is interesting that up to the 1950s a \"quantity\" was defined as what we now describe as \"magnitude\" (e.g., the unabridged Webster's New International Dictionary, 1948, gives examples of a sphere's surface being a quantity, its area a magnitude, or a yardstick being a quantity, its length a magnitude). This practice is now obsolete and at present length is a quantity, its numerical value its magnitude."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b98acc8d-9f17-3512-95ca-c6ec1cbdb3f7",
                                        "entry_id": "9ee3d203-6f5c-315b-a8a6-045d5ee4498d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An indefinite amount of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e45d725-735a-44d1-a051-d3e349921567",
                                                "sense_id": "b98acc8d-9f17-3512-95ca-c6ec1cbdb3f7",
                                                "text": "Some soap making oils are best as base oils, used in a larger quantity in the soap, while other oils are best added in a small quantity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f1e3421-6f42-4f08-b3c3-04c5bd7369a1",
                                                "sense_id": "b98acc8d-9f17-3512-95ca-c6ec1cbdb3f7",
                                                "text": "Olive oil can be used practically in any quantity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3267554-607f-3824-9edc-bc14d3d0eb92",
                                        "entry_id": "9ee3d203-6f5c-315b-a8a6-045d5ee4498d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A specific measured amount."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01b3e3cd-74f5-4432-87a0-76ccc927588e",
                                                "sense_id": "c3267554-607f-3824-9edc-bc14d3d0eb92",
                                                "text": "This bag would normally cost $497.50 for a quantity of 250, at a price of $1.99 per piece."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "936ca25c-7a95-4ebc-b134-0f5a3c23e975",
                                                "sense_id": "c3267554-607f-3824-9edc-bc14d3d0eb92",
                                                "text": "Generally it should not be used in a quantity larger than 15 percent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1834efe3-1cde-37bc-9ce9-a6cf94d547cb",
                                        "entry_id": "9ee3d203-6f5c-315b-a8a6-045d5ee4498d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A considerable measure or amount."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04ccbfe1-5d0e-4061-b71d-a31c93b212be",
                                                "sense_id": "1834efe3-1cde-37bc-9ce9-a6cf94d547cb",
                                                "text": "The Boeing P-26A was the first all-metal monoplane fighter produced in quantity for the U.S. Army Air Corps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e60bb70-1acc-3b70-b9e9-4a825fdb0f53",
                                        "entry_id": "9ee3d203-6f5c-315b-a8a6-045d5ee4498d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Property of a phenomenon, body, or substance, where the property has a magnitude that can be expressed as number and a reference."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7d99586-6a5a-3c51-8a40-1f3ba762205d",
                                        "entry_id": "9ee3d203-6f5c-315b-a8a6-045d5ee4498d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Indicates that the entire preceding expression is henceforth considered a single object."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9c02a26-fff6-4316-a583-bc8029952ae0",
                                                "sense_id": "e7d99586-6a5a-3c51-8a40-1f3ba762205d",
                                                "text": "x plus y quantity squared equals x squared plus 2xy plus y squared."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d44b43ad-9f51-4578-988d-a46fcdd62115",
                                                "sense_id": "e7d99586-6a5a-3c51-8a40-1f3ba762205d",
                                                "text": "For problems 58-67, translate each word phrase into an algebraic expression. […] 65. x plus 9, the quantity squared"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06c429ee-5d50-4915-8f83-84266a19ebda",
                                                "sense_id": "e7d99586-6a5a-3c51-8a40-1f3ba762205d",
                                                "text": "The second, (#92;sumx)², read \"summation of x, quantity squared,\" tells us to first add up all the xs to get #92;sumx and then square #92;sumx to get (#92;sumx)²."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bb35ad3-d37c-4d15-acd0-fd498f2dea61",
                                                "sense_id": "e7d99586-6a5a-3c51-8a40-1f3ba762205d",
                                                "text": "ANN. ra quantity cubed.\nSERGE LANG. That's right, (ra)³."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "457c2c34-a21b-3bb1-ae90-f1ba6cdd3084",
                                        "entry_id": "9ee3d203-6f5c-315b-a8a6-045d5ee4498d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Length of sounds."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9ce90571-e42c-457f-b0fc-f682cef201dc",
                        "source_entry_id": "1665f8f6-5bdf-3d02-ac14-3fcfbf4e0d9e",
                        "source_sense_id": "1fa5e235-fb05-3068-b559-5495f14648a7",
                        "target_lang_word": "quantité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quantité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b192aaae-b004-3da9-ad24-e2d0e6fc0732",
                                        "entry_id": "c14a2c1d-8c80-31c9-b03a-a604652a757b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tout ce qui peut être mesuré par un nombre, et par conséquent susceptible d’accroissement ou de diminution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68d4c5a5-e5d2-4761-b742-3060b4b7862f",
                                                "sense_id": "b192aaae-b004-3da9-ad24-e2d0e6fc0732",
                                                "text": "[…] ; une petite quantité de farine de seigle, mêlée à la farine de blé, lui communique une saveur agréable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e62c9f2-76c3-45cf-8819-ad416f94d5c8",
                                                "sense_id": "b192aaae-b004-3da9-ad24-e2d0e6fc0732",
                                                "text": "Les petits faux sauniers imaginaient aussi toutes sortes de camouflages pour passer de faibles quantités de faux sel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b3cbe81-6561-3b06-a981-8ae4fbb12dee",
                                        "entry_id": "c14a2c1d-8c80-31c9-b03a-a604652a757b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nombre plus ou moins grand, proportion plus ou moins grande de personnes ou de choses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5963f3c-45c7-4e39-9108-4514a7b07447",
                                                "sense_id": "8b3cbe81-6561-3b06-a981-8ae4fbb12dee",
                                                "text": "Devant une table, encombrée par un chanteau de pain, une demi-meule de gruyère et une innombrable quantité de bouteilles vides, les deux amis qu’on croyait morts devisaient paisiblement comme des sages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b783a49-030e-4c6c-8dc6-fa34d56f2e06",
                                                "sense_id": "8b3cbe81-6561-3b06-a981-8ae4fbb12dee",
                                                "text": "L’opération a donc pris quatre jours. Elle a entraîné la perte de nombreuses vies humaines et d’une quantité de bêtes et de bagages."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a00b6bb-3df8-3a8f-ba15-315db8715f91",
                                        "entry_id": "c14a2c1d-8c80-31c9-b03a-a604652a757b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Multitude, abondance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "513160ce-c407-4d02-bdaa-8e8c045addc0",
                                                "sense_id": "1a00b6bb-3df8-3a8f-ba15-315db8715f91",
                                                "text": "Même alors, son esprit n’en fut pas autrement frappé. Ce n’était qu’un fait de plus au milieu d’une innombrable quantité de faits extraordinaires et inévitables."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ec1e7e5-8c64-4e7c-b1f3-dd70ded0e6db",
                                                "sense_id": "1a00b6bb-3df8-3a8f-ba15-315db8715f91",
                                                "text": "La qualité des choses est souvent préférable à la quantité."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1fdf846a-c700-383f-9254-657b01ab7a29",
                                        "entry_id": "c14a2c1d-8c80-31c9-b03a-a604652a757b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Quantité vocalique. Durée longue ou brève des syllabes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Prosodie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e78d665-a945-4908-b697-93f6694821a2",
                                                "sense_id": "1fdf846a-c700-383f-9254-657b01ab7a29",
                                                "text": "La versification latine et la versification grecque sont fondées sur la quantité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "868a9135-52a4-48af-9356-6ab870e2e6c7",
                                                "sense_id": "1fdf846a-c700-383f-9254-657b01ab7a29",
                                                "text": "Les règles de la quantité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14a4c124-10d9-420c-bbad-9c6125c7fe1d",
                                                "sense_id": "1fdf846a-c700-383f-9254-657b01ab7a29",
                                                "text": "Il y a une faute de quantité dans ce vers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3c4a728-c7b3-4cca-a1c1-e19d04edef65",
                                                "sense_id": "1fdf846a-c700-383f-9254-657b01ab7a29",
                                                "text": "Je souffre de me voir accablé d’éloges que je ne mérite pas, on me prend pour un fort, je ne suis qu’un simple filou. Je vole à droite, à gauche, je ramasse des rejets au coin des livres. Je suis même malhonnête quelquefois. J’ai besoin d’une épithète ; peu m’importe de sacrifier la vérité ! Je prends dans le dictionnaire le mot qui fait l’affaire, quand même il dirait le contraire de ce que je voulais dire. Je perds la notion juste ! Il me faut mon spondée ou mon dactyle, tant pis ! — la qualité n’est rien, c’est la quantité qui est tout."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62ad5621-0f14-40b7-8482-3dcc7b2bdcc2",
                                                "sense_id": "1fdf846a-c700-383f-9254-657b01ab7a29",
                                                "text": "Et qu’ai-je fait de mal ? des fautes de quantité et de grammaire, voilà tout. Puis j’ai, sur un faux renseignement, dit qu’il y avait huit facultés de l’âme quand il n’y en a que sept."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "667c916a-57a4-475c-a162-7c9cb0604502",
                                                "sense_id": "1fdf846a-c700-383f-9254-657b01ab7a29",
                                                "text": "Les Américains, quand ils sont nouveaux ici, prononcent le latin à l’espagnole ; mais on leur apprend bien vite à le prononcer à la française. Il ne s’agit pas seulement de certaines lettres ; il s’agit aussi de la quantité des voyelles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75d3effa-46a7-3737-8c8e-8587669ca2eb",
                                        "entry_id": "c14a2c1d-8c80-31c9-b03a-a604652a757b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Durée relative que les notes ou les syllabes doivent avoir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8609598-6506-4da7-a06b-16e06d066aa1",
                                                "sense_id": "75d3effa-46a7-3737-8c8e-8587669ca2eb",
                                                "text": "La quantité produit le rythme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
